KoboFrotz - A Kobo interpreter for all Infocom games and other Z-machine games
based on Frotz V2.43

KDE port written by Peter Bienstman <Peter.Bienstman@UGent.be>, based on code
by David Griffith and others. (See AUTHORS file for more details.)

## Building for Kobo E-Readers

For detailed instructions on how to build KoboFrotz for Kobo devices 
(including Kobo Libra Colour with Firmware 4.44+), see [BUILD.md](BUILD.md).

### Quick Build with Docker (Easiest)

```bash
# Interactive Docker build
docker run --rm -it -v "$PWD":/work -w /work rain92/kobo-qt-dev

# Inside container:
mkdir -p build-kobo && cd build-kobo
/home/user/qt-bin/qt-linux-5.15-kde-kobo/bin/qmake ../KoboFrotz.pro CONFIG+=release
make -j"$(nproc)"
```

### Automated Build

```bash
./setup-toolchain.sh --docker   # Generate build script
./build-docker.sh               # Build ARM binary
./deploy-kobo.sh /media/$USER/KOBOeReader
```

